# Per-repo release values, sourced by scripts/release/_lib.sh. preflight,
# postflight and sync-dev are separate entry points, so a value declared in one
# script is missing from the other two; this file is the one place all three
# read.

# Every release branch strips the `anc web` code (the `web` feature) that dev
# keeps, and leaves out the `(web)` PRs' changelog bullets, so each release
# removes Cargo.toml lines dev still holds. Drift gate 0 therefore compares the
# manifest by its version alone; CHANGELOG.md stays on the line check. This
# holds for as long as release branches strip the web feature.
DRIFT_MANIFEST_COMPARE="version"
